Third-party files in this repository
------------------------------------

The following is not part of the distribution: the wheel ships `src/caravan` alone.

- docs/_static/images/ — the site's imagery (feature 011). The images are generated, never
  fetched: each one is drawn by a diffusion model from a written prompt, and the full recipe sits
  beside it in its `image.yaml`. The images themselves are released under CC0 1.0 Universal
  (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/) — no rights reserved. The models that
  produced them are both Apache License 2.0:
    - black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B (draft passes) —
      https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.2-klein-4B
    - Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512 (final passes) — https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512
  These are published with the documentation site and are not part of the distribution.

- docs/_themes/caravan/static/fonts/ — Archivo and JetBrains Mono, variable, Latin subset.
  Copyright 2020 The Archivo Project Authors; copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors.
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, full text in OFL.txt beside the files. These are published with the
  documentation site.

